 well-formed PRDs with user stories, acceptance criteria, and technical approach. Use when planning new features, creating specifications, or when user asks to create/generate a PRD."},"features":{"zh":["生成结构化产品需求文档","包括用户故事、验收标准和技术方法","适用于新功能规划、创建规格或用户请求","通过引导式问题创建PRD","支持技术团队高效合作"],"ja":["構造化された製品要件文書を生成","ユーザー故事、受け入れ基準、技術アプローチを含む","新機能の計画、規格の作成、またはユーザーのリクエストに適している","ガイド付きの質問を通じてPRDを作成","技術チームの効率的なコラボレーションをサポート"],"ko":["구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서 생성","사용자 스토리, 수락 기준, 기술 접근 방식 포함","새로운 기능 계획, 규격 생성 또는 사용자 요청에 적합","가이드 질문을 통해 PRD 생성","기술 팀의 효율적인 협업 지원"],"es":["Genera documentos de requisitos de producto estructurados","Crea historias de usuario y criterios de aceptación","Incluye enfoque técnico y especificaciones","Utiliza herramientas de IA para agilizar el proceso","Permite la planificación de nuevas características y la creación de especificaciones"],"fr":["Générez des documents de spécifications de produit structurés","Créez des histoires d''utilisateurs et des critères d''acceptation","Incluez une approche technique et des spécifications","Utilisez des outils d''IA pour accélérer le processus","Permet la planification de nouvelles fonctionnalités et la création de spécifications"],"de":["Erstellen Sie strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumente","Erstellen Sie Benutzerstories und Akzeptanzkriterien","Inklusive technischer Ansatz und Spezifikationen","Nutzen Sie KI-Tools, um den Prozess zu beschleunigen","Ermöglicht die Planung neuer Funktionen und die Erstellung von Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Geração de documentos de requisitos de produto estruturados","Criação de histórias de usuário e critérios de aceitação","Abordagem técnica personalizada","Perguntas orientadas para facilitar a criação de PRD","Suporte à planejamento de recursos novos e especifiqueções"],"ru":["Генерация структурированных документов требований продукта","Создание историй пользователя и критериев принятия","Индивидуальный технический подход","Руководящие вопросы для облегчения создания PRD","Поддержка планирования новых функций и создания спецификаций"],"ar":["إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج المنظمة","إنشاء قصص المستخدم و معايير القبول","نهج فني مخصص","أسئلة موجهة لتسهيل إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج","دعم تخطيط الميزات الجديدة وتحديد المواصفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント","prd工具","生成产品需求文档","结构化产品需求文档","产品需求文档模板","如何创建prd","prd与需求分析","prd工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","prdツール","製品要件文書を生成","構造化された製品要件文書","製品要件文書テンプレート","prdを作成する方法","prdと要件分析","prdツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","prd 도구","제품 요구 사항 문서 생성","구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서","제품 요구 사항 문서 템플릿","prdを作成하는 방법","prd와 요구 사항 분석","prd 도구 비교"],"es":["herramientas de ia para prd","generar documentos de requisitos de producto","prd para desarrolladores","como utilizar herramientas de ia para prd","alternativas a prd","prd vs especificaciones","instalacion de prd","guia de configuracion de prd"],"fr":["outils d''ia pour prd","générer des documents de spécifications de produit","prd pour développeurs","comment utiliser des outils d''ia pour prd","alternatives à prd","prd vs spécifications","installation de prd","guide de configuration de prd"],"de":["ki-tools für prd","erstellen von produktanforderungsdokumenten","prd für entwickler","wie man ki-tools für prd verwendet","alternativen zu prd","prd vs spezifikationen","installation von prd","anleitung zur konfiguration von prd"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","prd","documentos de requisitos de produto","como usar prd","o que é prd","prd vs spec","instalar prd","guia de configuração do prd"],"ru":["ии агенты","prd","документы требований продукта","как использовать прд","что такое прд","prd vs spec","установить прд","руководство по настройке прд"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","prd","وثائق متطلبات المنتج","كيفية استخدام وثائق متطلبات المنتج","ما هي وثائق متطلبات المنتج","prd vs spec","تثبيت وثائق متطلبات المنتج","دليل إعداد وثائق متطلبات المنتج"]}},"owner":"davidkimai","repo":"ralph-zero","repoPath":"davidkimai/ralph-zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.575Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generate structured Product Requirements Documents through guided questions. Creates well-formed PRDs with user stories, acceptance criteria, and technical approach. Use when planning new features, creating specifications, or when user asks to create/generate a PRD.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generation Skill\n\nGenerate comprehensive, structured Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) through an interactive question-and-answer workflow optimized for autonomous development.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- User asks to \"create a PRD\" or \"generate requirements\"\n- Planning a new feature before implementation\n- Need to document requirements for Ralph Zero\n- Want to break down complex features into implementable stories\n\n## Workflow\n\nThis skill follows a structured 5-step proces","body":"# PRD Generation Skill\n\nGenerate comprehensive, structured Product Requirements Documents (PRDs) through an interactive question-and-answer workflow optimized for autonomous development.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- User asks to \"create a PRD\" or \"generate requirements\"\n- Planning a new feature before implementation\n- Need to document requirements for Ralph Zero\n- Want to break down complex features into implementable stories\n\n## Workflow\n\nThis skill follows a structured 5-step process to create production-ready PRDs.\n\n### Step 1: Get Feature Description\n\nAsk the user for a high-level description:\n\n```\nWhat feature would you like to build? Please provide a brief description.\n```\n\n### Step 2: Ask Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk these essential questions with **letter options** for quick responses:\n\n#### 1. Problem & Goals\n```\n1. What problem does this feature solve?\n   A. User pain point / friction\n   B. Business requirement\n   C. Technical debt / refactoring\n   D. Competitive feature parity\n   E. Other: [specify]\n```\n\n#### 2. Target Users\n```\n2. Who will use this feature?\n   A. End users only\n   B. Admin users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Developers / internal team\n   E. External integrations\n```\n\n#### 3. Scope\n```\n3. What is the desired scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version (fastest path)\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Backend/API only (no UI)\n   D. Frontend/UI only (mock backend)\n```\n\n#### 4. Technical Constraints\n```\n4. Any technical constraints or requirements?\n   A. Must integrate with existing system X\n   B. Performance requirements (specify)\n   C. Security/compliance requirements\n   D. No special constraints\n```\n\n#### 5. Success Measurement\n```\n5. How will you measure success?\n   A. User metrics (engagement, retention)\n   B. Business metrics (conversion, revenue)\n   C. Technical metrics (performance, quality)\n   D. Simply: feature works as specified\n```\n\n**Allow user to respond:** `1A, 2C, 3A, 4D, 5D` for efficient iteration.\n\n### Step 3: Generate PRD\n\nBased on answers, generate a PRD using this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# [Feature Name]\n\n## Executive Summary\n[2-3 sentence overview]\n\n## Problem Statement\n[What problem are we solving and why]\n\n## Goals\n- Goal 1: [Specific, measurable]\n- Goal 2: [Specific, measurable]\n- Goal 3: [Specific, measurable]\n\n## User Stories\n\nFor each story, use this format:\n\n### US-001: [Story Title]\n**Description:** As a [user type], I want to [action], so that [benefit].\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific, verifiable criterion 1\n- [ ] Specific, verifiable criterion 2\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] [UI stories only] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n**Priority:** 1\n\n**Notes:** [Any implementation hints or context]\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: The system must [specific requirement]\n- FR-2: When [condition], the system must [behavior]\n- FR-3: [Specific, testable requirement]\n\n## Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\n\n- What we''re explicitly NOT doing\n- Features deferred to future iterations\n- Edge cases intentionally not handled\n\n## Technical Approach\n\n### Architecture\n[High-level technical approach]\n\n### Data Model\n[Key schema changes or data structures]\n\n### APIs/Inte grations\n[External systems, endpoints needed]\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Metric 1: [target value]\n- Metric 2: [target value]\n\n## Timeline & Milestones\n\n- Phase 1: [description] - [timeframe]\n- Phase 2: [description] - [timeframe]\n\n## Dependencies\n\n- Dependency 1: [what and why]\n- Dependency 2: [what and why]\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Question 1\n- Question 2\n```\n\n### Step 4: Save PRD\n\nSave to `tasks/prd-[feature-name-kebab-case].md`\n\nExamples:\n- \"User Authentication\" → `tasks/prd-user-authentication.md`\n- \"Task Priority System\" → `tasks/prd-task-priority.md`\n\n### Step 5: Next Steps\n\nAfter saving, inform the user:\n\n```\n✅ PRD saved to tasks/prd-[feature-name].md\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review and refine the PRD as needed\n2. Convert to prd.json: Load ralph-convert skill and convert tasks/prd-[feature-name].md to prd.json\n3. Run Ralph Zero: ralph-zero run --max-iterations 50\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Keep Stories Atomic\n\nEach user story should be:\n- **Specific**: Clear about what needs to be done\n- **Testable**: Can be verified when complete\n- **Independent**: Minimal dependencies on other stories\n- **Small**: Completable in one iteration (30min - 2hrs)\n\n### Write Verifiable Acceptance Criteria\n\n✅ **Good criteria (specific, testable):**\n- \"Add status column to tasks table (''pending'' | ''in_progress'' | ''done'')\"\n- \"Badge shows green for done, blue for in_progress, gray for pending\"\n- \"Clicking delete shows confirmation dialog with Cancel/Confirm buttons\"\n\n❌ **Bad criteria (vague, untestable):**\n- \"Status works correctly\"\n- \"Good UX\"\n- \"User can easily do X\"\n- \"Handles all edge cases\"\n\n### Order Stories by Dependency\n\nStories should execute in dependency order:\n\n**Correct order:**\n1. Schema/database changes\n2. Backend logic/server actions\n3. UI components\n4. Dashboard/aggregation views\n\n**Wrong order:**\n- UI component at priority 1 that needs schema from priority 3\n\n### Always Include Quality Checks\n\nEvery story must have:\n- `Typecheck passes` as final criterion\n- `Tests pass` if testable logic\n- `Verify in browser using dev-browser skill` if UI changes\n\n## Example Interaction\n\n**User:** \"Create a PRD for adding task priority levels\"\n\n**Agent (you):**\n```\nI''ll help you create a PRD for task priority levels. Let me ask some clarifying questions:\n\n1. What problem does this feature solve?\n   A. User pain point / friction\n   B. Business requirement\n   C. Technical debt / refactoring\n   D. Competitive feature parity\n   E. Other: [specify]\n\n[User: 1A]\n\n2. Who will use this feature?\n   A. End users only\n   B. Admin users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Developers / internal team\n   E. External integrations\n\n[User: 2C]\n\n...\n\n[After gathering all answers]\n\nGreat! Here''s your PRD:\n\n# Task Priority System\n\n## Executive Summary\nAdd priority levels (high, medium, low) to tasks so users can focus on what matters most...\n\n[Generate complete PRD]\n\n✅ PRD saved to tasks/prd-task-priority.md\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review the PRD\n2. Convert to prd.json using ralph-convert skill\n3. Run Ralph Zero\n```\n\n## Customization\n\nFor project-specific templates, create:\n```\nskills/prd/references/CUSTOM_TEMPLATE.md\n```\n\nThen reference it:\n```\nUse the custom PRD template from references/CUSTOM_TEMPLATE.md\n```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### Avoid Vague Requirements\n❌ \"Make the UI better\"\n✅ \"Add visual feedback on hover (scale to 1.05, show shadow)\"\n\n### Avoid Mixing Concerns\n❌ \"Add authentication and dashboard\"\n✅ Split into: Auth schema, Auth UI, Dashboard\n\n### Avoid Future-Proofing\n❌ \"Design for eventual multi-tenant support\"\n✅ \"Implement single-tenant, document extension points\"\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **ralph-convert**: Convert this PRD to prd.json\n- **ralph-zero**: Run autonomous development loop\n\n## See Also\n\n- [PRD Template](references/TEMPLATE.md)\n- [PRD Best Practices](references/BEST_PRACTICES.md)\n- [Story Sizing Guide](references/STORY_SIZING.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:17:14.323Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured Product Requirements Document generation through interactive workflows.","zh":"适用于需要通过交互式工作流生成结构化产品需求文档的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントがインタラクティブなワークフローを通じて構造化された製品要件文書を生成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 대화형 워크플로우를 통해 구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan generar un Documento de Requisitos de Producto estructurado a través de flujos de trabajo interactivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de générer un Document de Spécifications de Produit structuré via des flux de travail interactifs.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die ein strukturiertes Produktanforderungsdokument durch interaktive Arbeitsabläufe benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de geração de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto estruturados por meio de fluxos de trabalho interativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима генерация структурированных документов требований к продукту посредством интерактивных рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعمال التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج المنظمة من خلال سير عمل تفاعلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive, structured Product Requirements Documents through an interactive question-and-answer workflow, utilizing error handling and process scheduling features from Ralph Zero, optimized for autonomous development and implementing complex multi-step features.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面、结构化的产品需求文档的能力，通过交互式的问答工作流，利用Ralph Zero的错误处理和流程调度功能，针对自治开发和复杂的多步骤功能进行优化。","ja":"エージェントは、Ralph Zero のエラーハンドリングとプロセススケジューリング機能を使用して、インタラクティブな質問と回答のワークフローを通じて、包括的かつ構造化された製品要件文書を生成することができます。オートノマス開発と複雑なマルチステップ機能の実装に最適化されています。","ko":"에이전트는 랄프 제로의 오류 처리 및 프로세스 스케줄링 기능을 사용하여 대화형 질문 및 답변 워크플로우를 통해 포괄적이고 구조화된 제품 요구 사항 문서를 생성할 수 있습니다. 자율 개발 및 복잡한 멀티스텝 기능 구현을 위해 최적화되었습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar Documentos de Requisitos de Producto integrales y estructurados a través de un flujo de trabajo interactivo de preguntas y respuestas, utilizando características de manejo de errores y programación de procesos de Ralph Zero, optimizado para el desarrollo autónomo e implementación de características complejas de varios pasos.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour générer des Documents de Spécifications de Produit complets et structurés via un flux de travail interactif de questions et réponses, en utilisant les fonctionnalités de gestion des erreurs et de planification de processus de Ralph Zero, optimisé pour le développement autonome et la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités complexes à plusieurs étapes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende, strukturierte Produktanforderungsdokumente durch einen interaktiven Frage- und Antwort-Workflow zu generieren, der Fehlerbehandlungs- und Prozessplanungsmerkmale von Ralph Zero verwendet, optimiert für autonomes Entwicklung und Implementierung komplexer Mehrschrittmerkmale.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar documentos abrangentes e estruturados de Requisitos de Produto por meio de um fluxo de trabalho interativo de perguntas e respostas, utilizando recursos de tratamento de erros e programação de processos do Ralph Zero, otimizado para desenvolvimento autônomo e implementação de recursos complexos de vários passos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные и структурированные документы требований к продукту посредством интерактивного рабочего процесса вопросов и ответов, использующего функции обработки ошибок и планирования процессов от Ralph Zero, оптимизированные для автономной разработки и реализации сложных многоступенчатых функций.","ar":"تمكّن العمال من إنشاء مستندات شاملة ومنظمة لمتطلبات المنتج من خلال سير عمل تفاعلي للأسئلة والإجابات، مع استخدام ميزات معالجة الأخطاء وجدولة العمليات من رالف زيرو، محسّن لتنمية مستقلة وتنفيذ ميزات معقدة متعددة الخطوات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating PRDs for new feature implementation","Breaking down complex features into implementable stories","Documenting requirements for Ralph Zero orchestrator system"],"zh":["为新功能实现生成 PRD","将复杂的功能分解为可实施的故事","记录 Ralph Zero 오케스트레이터 시스템的要求"],"ja":["新しい機能の実装のための PRD の生成","複雑な機能を実装可能なストーリーに分解する","Ralph Zero オーケストレーター システムの要件を文書化する"],"ko":["새로운 기능 구현을 위한 PRD 생성","복잡한 기능을 구현 가능한 스토리로 분해","랄프 제로 오케스트레이터 시스템의 요구 사항 문서화"],"es":["Generar PRD para la implementación de nuevas características","Descomponer características complejas en historias implementables","Documentar requisitos para el sistema orquestador Ralph Zero"],"fr":["Générer des PRD pour la mise en œuvre de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Décomposer des fonctionnalités complexes en histoires implementables","Documenter les exigences pour le système d''orchestration Ralph Zero"],"de":["PRD für die Implementierung neuer Funktionen generieren","Komplexe Funktionen in umsetzbare Geschichten aufteilen","Anforderungen für das Ralph Zero-Orchestrierungssystem dokumentieren"],"pt":["Geração de PRDs para implementação de novos recursos","Divisão de recursos complexos em histórias implementáveis","Documentação de requisitos para o sistema de orquestrador Ralph Zero"],"ru":["Генерация документов требований к продукту для реализации новых функций","Разделение сложных функций на реализуемые истории","Документирование требований для системы-оркестратора Ralph Zero"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات متطلبات المنتج لتنفيذ الميزات الجديدة","تقسيم الميزات المعقدة إلى قصص يمكن تنفيذها","توثيق متطلبات نظام رالف زيرو للتنسيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Ralph Zero orchestrator system integration","Limited to generating Product Requirements Documents"],"zh":["需要集成 Ralph Zero 오케스트레이터 시스템","仅限生成产品需求文档"],"ja":["Ralph Zero オーケストレーター システムの統合が必要","製品要件文書の生成のみ"],"ko":["랄프 제로 오케스트레이터 시스템 통합 필요","제품 요구 사항 문서 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere integración con el sistema orquestador Ralph Zero","Limitado a la generación de Documentos de Requisitos de Producto"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec le système d''orchestration Ralph Zero","Limité à la génération de Documents de Spécifications de Produit"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit dem Ralph Zero-Orchestrierungssystem","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Produktanforderungsdokumenten"],"pt":["Exige integração com o sistema de orquestrador Ralph Zero","Limitado à geração de Documentos de Requisitos de Produto"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с системой-оркестратором Ralph Zero","Ограничен генерацией документов требований к продукту"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع نظام رالف زيرو للتنسيق","محدود بالإنشاء المستندات لمتطلبات المنتج"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"83ea93fc1dd955868057bbd8fe2aa6c25a94f67fde40b749de1dce7a62410b2d","qualityScore":80}');
