alidad","Protocolos de replicación para resultados confiables","Integración con LaTeX/Beamer + R para proyectos de investigación","Adversarial QA para mejorar la precisión","Calidad de código garantizada con gates de calidad"],"fr":["Revue multi-agent pour garantir la qualité","Protocoles de réplication pour des résultats fiables","Intégration avec LaTeX/Beamer + R pour les projets de recherche","Adversarial QA pour améliorer la précision","Qualité de code garantie avec des portes de qualité"],"de":["Multi-Agenten-Überprüfung für Qualitätsgarantie","Replikationsprotokolle für zuverlässige Ergebnisse","Integration mit LaTeX/Beamer + R für Forschungsprojekte","Adversarial QA für verbesserte Genauigkeit","Code-Qualität garantiert mit Qualitäts-Toren"],"pt":["Revisão multi-agente","Protocolos de replicação","Integração com LaTeX/Beamer + R","Fácil fork e personalização","Suporte a qualidade e gates","Adversarial QA"],"ru":["Многоагентная проверка","Протоколы репликации","Интеграция с LaTeX/Beamer + R","Легкий форк и настройка","Поддержка качества и гейтов","Противостоящая QA"],"ar":["مراجعة متعددة الوكلاء","بروتوكولات التكرار","التكامل مع LaTeX/Beamer + R","فورك وتصميم سهل","دعم الجودة والبوابات","QA المعارض"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 智能工具","LaTeX/Beamer + R","学术模板","多agent审查","质量控制","对抗性 QA","如何使用 learn","learn 安装指南","learn 代替品"],"ja":["AI エージェント","LaTeX/Beamer + R","学術テンプレート","多agentレビュー","品質ゲート","対抗性 QA","learn の使い方","learn インストールガイド","learn の代替"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","LaTeX/Beamer + R","학술 템플릿","다중 에이전트 검토","품질 게이트","적대적 QA","learn 사용 방법","learn 설치 가이드","learn 대체"],"es":["herramientas de AI para académicos","plantilla Claude Code","LaTeX/Beamer + R","revisión multi-agente","protocolos de replicación","cómo usar Claude Code","alternativas a Claude Code","instalación de Claude Code"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les universitaires","modèle Claude Code","LaTeX/Beamer + R","revue multi-agent","protocoles de réplication","comment utiliser Claude Code","alternatives à Claude Code","installation de Claude Code"],"de":["KI-Tools für Akademiker","Claude Code-Vorlage","LaTeX/Beamer + R","Multi-Agenten-Überprüfung","Replikationsprotokolle","wie man Claude Code verwendet","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Installation von Claude Code"],"pt":["como usar Claude Code","o que é modelo de IA","Claude Code alternativa","Claude Code vs outros","instalar Claude Code","guia de configuração do Claude Code","desenvolvimento de soluções de IA","ferramentas de IA para acadêmicos"],"ru":["как использовать Claude Code","что такое ИИ агент","альтернатива Claude Code","Claude Code vs другие","установить Claude Code","руководство по настройке Claude Code","разработка решений ИИ","инструменты ИИ для академиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Claude Code","ما هو نموذج الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل Claude Code","Claude Code مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت Claude Code","دليل إعداد Claude Code","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للباحثين"]}},"owner":"pedrohcgs","repo":"claude-code-my-workflow","repoPath":"pedrohcgs/claude-code-my-workflow","stars":476,"forks":635,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:15:41Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"learn","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# /learn — Skill Extraction Workflow\n\nExtract non-obvious discoveries into reusable skills that persist across sessions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke `/learn` when you encounter:\n\n- **Non-obvious debugging** — Investigation that took significant effort, not in docs\n- **Misleading errors** — Error message was wrong, found the real cause\n- **Workarounds** — Found a limitation with a creative solution\n- **Tool integration** — Undocumented API usage or configuration\n- **Trial-and-error** — Mul","body":"# /learn — Skill Extraction Workflow\n\nExtract non-obvious discoveries into reusable skills that persist across sessions.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke `/learn` when you encounter:\n\n- **Non-obvious debugging** — Investigation that took significant effort, not in docs\n- **Misleading errors** — Error message was wrong, found the real cause\n- **Workarounds** — Found a limitation with a creative solution\n- **Tool integration** — Undocumented API usage or configuration\n- **Trial-and-error** — Multiple attempts before success\n- **Repeatable workflows** — Multi-step task you''d do again\n- **User-facing automation** — Reports, checks, or processes users will request\n\n## Workflow Phases\n\n### PHASE 1: Evaluate (Self-Assessment)\n\nBefore creating a skill, answer these questions:\n\n1. \"What did I just learn that wasn''t obvious before starting?\"\n2. \"Would future-me benefit from this being documented?\"\n3. \"Was the solution non-obvious from documentation alone?\"\n4. \"Is this a multi-step workflow I''d repeat?\"\n\n**Continue only if YES to at least one question.**\n\n### PHASE 2: Check Existing Skills\n\nSearch for related skills to avoid duplication:\n\n```bash\n# Check project skills\nls .claude/skills/ 2>/dev/null\n\n# Search for keywords\ngrep -r -i \"KEYWORD\" .claude/skills/ 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n**Outcomes:**\n- Nothing related → Create new skill (continue to Phase 3)\n- Same trigger & fix → Update existing skill (bump version)\n- Partial overlap → Update with new variant\n\n### PHASE 3: Create Skill\n\nCreate the skill file at `.claude/skills/[skill-name]/SKILL.md`:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: descriptive-kebab-case-name\ndescription: |\n  [CRITICAL: Include specific triggers in the description]\n  - What the skill does\n  - Specific trigger conditions (exact error messages, symptoms)\n  - When to use it (contexts, scenarios)\nauthor: Claude Code Academic Workflow\nversion: 1.0.0\nargument-hint: \"[expected arguments]\"  # Optional\n---\n\n# Skill Name\n\n## Problem\n[Clear problem description — what situation triggers this skill]\n\n## Context / Trigger Conditions\n[When to use — exact error messages, symptoms, scenarios]\n[Be specific enough that you''d recognize it again]\n\n## Solution\n[Step-by-step solution]\n[Include commands, code snippets, or workflows]\n\n## Verification\n[How to verify it worked]\n[Expected output or state]\n\n## Example\n[Concrete example of the skill in action]\n\n## References\n[Documentation links, related files, or prior discussions]\n```\n\n### PHASE 4: Quality Gates\n\nBefore finalizing, verify:\n\n- [ ] Description has specific trigger conditions (not vague)\n- [ ] Solution was verified to work (tested)\n- [ ] Content is specific enough to be actionable\n- [ ] Content is general enough to be reusable\n- [ ] No sensitive information (credentials, personal data)\n- [ ] Skill name is descriptive and uses kebab-case\n\n## Output\n\nAfter creating the skill, report:\n\n```\n✓ Skill created: .claude/skills/[name]/SKILL.md\n  Trigger: [when to use]\n  Problem: [what it solves]\n```\n\n## Example: Creating a Skill\n\nUser discovers that a specific R package silently drops observations:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: fixest-missing-covariate-handling\ndescription: |\n  Handle silent observation dropping in fixest when covariates have missing values.\n  Use when: estimates seem wrong, sample size unexpectedly small, or comparing\n  results between packages.\nauthor: Claude Code Academic Workflow\nversion: 1.0.0\n---\n\n# fixest Missing Covariate Handling\n\n## Problem\nThe fixest package silently drops observations when covariates have NA values,\nwhich can produce unexpected results when comparing to other packages.\n\n## Context / Trigger Conditions\n- Sample size in fixest is smaller than expected\n- Results differ from Stata or other R packages\n- Model has covariates with potential missing values\n\n## Solution\n1. Check for NA patterns before regression:\n   ```r\n   summary(complete.cases(data[, covariates]))\n   ```\n2. Explicitly handle NA values or use `na.action` parameter\n3. Document the expected sample size in comments\n\n## Verification\nCompare `nobs(model)` with `nrow(data)` — difference indicates dropped obs.\n\n## References\n- fixest documentation on missing values\n- [LEARN:r-code] entry in MEMORY.md\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T02:14:12.691Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Academic Agents needing advanced LaTeX and R integration for research and publication.","zh":"适用于需要高级 LaTeX 和 R 集成的学术代理，用于研究和出版。","ja":"学術エージェントが研究および出版のために高度なLaTeXとRの統合を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"연구 및 출판을 위해 고급 LaTeX와 R 통합이 필요한 학술 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes académicos que necesitan una integración avanzada de LaTeX y R para investigación y publicación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents académiques ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de LaTeX et R pour la recherche et la publication.","de":"Perfekt für akademische Agenten, die eine erweiterte Integration von LaTeX und R für Forschung und Veröffentlichung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Acadêmicos que necessitam de integração avançada de LaTeX e R para pesquisa e publicação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для академических агентов, которым требуется расширенная интеграция LaTeX и R для исследований и публикаций.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإيضاح الأكاديمية التي تحتاج إلى دمج متقدم من LaTeX و R لأغراض البحث والنشر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Claude Code templates for multi-agent review, quality gates, adversarial QA, and replication protocols, streamlining the research process with LaTeX/Beamer and R.","zh":"赋予代理使用Claude Code模板的能力，用于多代理审查、质量门、对抗性QA和复制协议，使用LaTeX/Beamer和R简化研究流程。","ja":"エージェントがClaude Codeテンプレートを利用してマルチエージェントレビュー、品質ゲート、対抗的QA、複製プロトコルを行えるようにし、LaTeX/BeamerおよびRで研究プロセスを合理化する。","ko":"에이전트가 Claude Code 템플릿을 사용하여 멀티 에이전트 리뷰, 품질 게이트, 적대적 QA 및 복제 프로토콜을 수행할 수 있도록 하여 LaTeX/Beamer 및 R로 연구 프로세스를 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar plantillas de Claude Code para revisión multiagente, puertas de calidad, pruebas de adversidad y protocolos de replicación, simplificando el proceso de investigación con LaTeX/Beamer y R.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des modèles de code Claude pour la révision multi-agents, les portes de qualité, les tests d''adversité et les protocoles de réplication, rationalisant ainsi le processus de recherche avec LaTeX/Beamer et R.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Vorlagen von Claude Code für die Multiagenten-Überprüfung, Qualitäts-Tore, Adversitäts-Tests und Replikationsprotokolle zu nutzen, wodurch der Forschungsprozess mit LaTeX/Beamer und R rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar modelos de código Claude para revisão multi-agente, portões de qualidade, QA adversarial e protocolos de replicação, racionalizando o processo de pesquisa com LaTeX/Beamer e R.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать шаблоны кода Claude для многоагентного обзора, контрольных точек качества, противоречивого QA и протоколов репликации, оптимизируя процесс исследования с помощью LaTeX/Beamer и R.","ar":"تمكّن الوسائل الإيضاحية من استخدام قوالب كлод للكود من أجل مراجعة متعددة الوكلاء، بوابات الجودة، جودة العدو وبروتوكولات التكرار، وتبسيط عملية البحث مع LaTeX/Beamer و R."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting non-obvious discoveries into reusable skills","Documenting workarounds for undocumented API usage or configuration","Conducting trial-and-error investigations with automated replication protocols"],"zh":["提取非明显的发现到可重用的技能","记录未记录的API使用或配置的解决方法","使用自动复制协议进行试验和错误调查"],"ja":["明らかでない発見を再利用可能なスキルに抽出する","未記載のAPIの使用や設定のためのワークアラウンドを文書化する","自動複製プロトコルを使用した試行錯誤による調査"],"ko":["명백하지 않은 발견을 재사용 가능한 기술로 추출하는 것","기록되지 않은 API 사용 또는 구성의 워크어라운드 문서화","자동 복제 프로토콜을 사용한 시도와 오류 조사"],"es":["Extraer descubrimientos no obvios en habilidades reutilizables","Documentar soluciones alternativas para usos o configuraciones de API no documentados","Realizar investigaciones de prueba y error con protocolos de replicación automatizados"],"fr":["Extraire des découvertes non évidentes en compétences réutilisables","Documenter des solutions de contournement pour des utilisations ou configurations d''API non documentées","Effectuer des investigations d''essai et d''erreur avec des protocoles de réplication automatisés"],"de":["Nicht offensichtliche Entdeckungen in wiederverwendbare Fähigkeiten extrahieren","Arbeitsumgehungen für nicht dokumentierte API-Nutzungen oder -Konfigurationen dokumentieren","Versuchs- und Irrtums-Untersuchungen mit automatisierten Replikationsprotokollen durchführen"],"pt":["Extração de descobertas não óbvias em habilidades reutilizáveis","Documentação de soluções para uso ou configuração de API não documentada","Realização de investigações de tentativa e erro com protocolos de replicação automatizados"],"ru":["Извлечение неочевидных открытий в многократно используемые навыки","Документирование обходных путей для неудокументированного использования или конфигурации API","Проведение пробных исследований с автоматизированными протоколами репликации"],"ar":["استخراج اكتشافات غير واضحة في مهارات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","توثيق حلول للتشغيل أو تكوين واجهة برمجة التطبيقات غير المocumented","إجراء تحقيقات تجريبية بالخطأ مع بروتوكولات تكرار آلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code template compatibility","LaTeX/Beamer and R expertise recommended","Limited to academic and research applications"],"zh":["需要Claude Code模板兼容性","推荐LaTeX/Beamer和R专长","仅限学术和研究应用"],"ja":["Claude Codeテンプレートの互換性が必要","LaTeX/BeamerおよびRの専門知識が推奨される","学術および研究アプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Claude Code 템플릿 호환성이 필요함","LaTeX/Beamer 및 R 전문 지식이 권장됨","학술 및 연구 응용 프로그램에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con plantillas de Claude Code","Se recomienda experiencia en LaTeX/Beamer y R","Limitado a aplicaciones académicas y de investigación"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité des modèles de code Claude","Une expertise en LaTeX/Beamer et R est recommandée","Limité aux applications académiques et de recherche"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit Vorlagen von Claude Code","Erfahrung mit LaTeX/Beamer und R wird empfohlen","Begrenzt auf akademische und Forschungsanwendungen"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com modelos de código Claude","Recomenda-se especialização em LaTeX/Beamer e R","Limitado a aplicações acadêmicas e de pesquisa"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с шаблонами кода Claude","Рекомендуется экспертиза в LaTeX/Beamer и R","Ограничен для академических и исследовательских приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقاً مع قوالب كلود للكود","يوصى بالتخصص في LaTeX/Beamer و R","محدود للتطبيقات الأكاديمية والبحثية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a69999259c3c5506c9d5ec43e24cd4e277b65b8cf79125affa85bcfd7d028b76","qualityScore":75}');
