nteligente entre múltiples cuentas de OpenAI API","Dashboard integrado para monitoreo de uso y estadísticas en tiempo real","Endpoints compatibles con el estándar OpenCode para fácil integración","Sistema de rate limiting configurable para evitar sobrecargas","Autenticación OAuth2 para acceso seguro a la API proxy","Backend con SQLAlchemy para almacenamiento flexible de datos de uso"],"fr":["Répartition de charge intelligente entre plusieurs comptes OpenAI API","Dashboard intégré pour monitoring d''usage et statistiques en temps réel","Endpoints compatibles avec le standard OpenCode pour intégration facile","Système de rate limiting configurable pour éviter les surcharges","Authentification OAuth2 pour un accès sécurisé à l''API proxy","Backend avec SQLAlchemy pour un stockage flexible des données d''usage"],"de":["Intelligentes Load Balancing zwischen mehreren OpenAI-API-Konten","Integriertes Dashboard für Nutzungs-Monitoring und Echtzeit-Statistiken","OpenCode-kompatible Endpoints für einfache Integration","Konfigurierbares Rate-Limit-System zur Vermeidung von Überlastung","OAuth2-Authentifizierung für sicheren Zugriff auf die Proxy-API","SQLAlchemy-Backend für flexible Speicherung von Nutzungsdaten"],"pt":["Balanciamento de carga para contas Codex/ChatGPT","Proxy com recursos de rastreamento de uso","Dashboard para monitorar o uso","Compatibilidade com OpenCode","Recursos de rate-limit e OAuth"],"ru":["Балансировка нагрузки для аккаунтов Codex/ChatGPT","Прокси с функциями отслеживания использования","Панель управления для мониторинга использования","Совместимость с OpenCode","Функции rate-limit и OAuth"],"ar":["موازنة الحمل لحسابات Codex/ChatGPT","وكيل مع ميزات تتبع الاستخدام","لوحة للرقابة على الاستخدام","التوافق مع OpenCode","ميزات الحد من المعدل و OAuth"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Codex Review Loop","负载均衡","代理","使用跟踪","如何使用 Codex Review Loop","Codex Review Loop 代替品","Codex Review Loop 安装"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Codex Review Loop","ロードバランサー","プロキシ","使用状況の追跡","Codex Review Loop の使用方法","Codex Review Loop の代替","Codex Review Loop の設定"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Codex Review Loop","로드밸런서","프록시","사용 추적","Codex Review Loop 사용법","Codex Review Loop 대체","Codex Review Loop 설치 가이드"],"es":["proxy api openai","load balancer codex","codex review loop install","dashboard tracking uso openai","endpoints opencode compatibles","como usar codex review loop","fastapi sqlalchemy proxy","alternativa a openai directo","gestion rate limit chatgpt","setup proxy cuentas multiples"],"fr":["proxy api openai","load balancer codex","codex review loop install","dashboard suivi usage openai","endpoints opencode compatibles","comment utiliser codex review loop","fastapi sqlalchemy proxy","alternative à openai direct","gestion rate limit chatgpt","setup proxy comptes multiples"],"de":["openai api proxy","codex load balancer","codex review loop install","dashboard nutzungs tracking openai","opencode endpoints kompatibel","wie verwendet man codex review loop","fastapi sqlalchemy proxy","alternative zu direktem openai","rate limit verwalten chatgpt","setup proxy mehrere konten"],"pt":["como usar Codex Review Loop","o que é Codex Review Loop","alternativas para Codex Review Loop","Codex Review Loop vs ChatGPT","instalar Codex Review Loop","guias de configuração para Codex Review Loop","rastreamento de uso em Codex Review Loop","dashboard para Codex Review Loop","OpenCode e Codex Review Loop"],"ru":["как использовать Codex Review Loop","что такое Codex Review Loop","альтернативы для Codex Review Loop","Codex Review Loop vs ChatGPT","установка Codex Review Loop","руководства по настройке для Codex Review Loop","отслеживание использования в Codex Review Loop","панель управления для Codex Review Loop","OpenCode и Codex Review Loop"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Codex Review Loop","ما هو Codex Review Loop","بديلات ل Codex Review Loop","Codex Review Loop مقابل ChatGPT","تثبيت Codex Review Loop","دليل إعدادات ل Codex Review Loop","تتبع الاستخدام في Codex Review Loop","لوحة التحكم ل Codex Review Loop","OpenCode و Codex Review Loop"]}},"owner":"Soju06","repo":"codex-lb","repoPath":"Soju06/codex-lb","stars":121,"forks":27,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T00:14:23Z","topics":["api-proxy","chatgpt","codex","dashboard","fastapi","load-balancer","oauth","openai","opencode","python","rate-limit","sqlalchemy","usage-tracking"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codex-review-loop","description":"|","version":"2.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Codex Review Loop\n\nAdversarial code review via Codex CLI, structured finding analysis,\nHITL-gated fix loop, optional re-verification.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `--pr <N>` — review PR number N (default: auto-detect most recent open PR)\n- `--base <branch>` — review changes against base branch\n- `--uncommitted` — review uncommitted local changes\n\n## Phases\n\n1. **Scope Resolution** — determine review target (PR/branch/uncommitted)\n2. **Codex Review** — launch adversarial review via Codex CLI (~20-50 min)\n3","body":"# Codex Review Loop\n\nAdversarial code review via Codex CLI, structured finding analysis,\nHITL-gated fix loop, optional re-verification.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `--pr <N>` — review PR number N (default: auto-detect most recent open PR)\n- `--base <branch>` — review changes against base branch\n- `--uncommitted` — review uncommitted local changes\n\n## Phases\n\n1. **Scope Resolution** — determine review target (PR/branch/uncommitted)\n2. **Codex Review** — launch adversarial review via Codex CLI (~20-50 min)\n3. **Finding Analysis** — parse raw output into structured findings\n4. **Atomic Fix Loop** — fix, verify, commit each approved finding\n5. **Re-review Loop** — re-run review until 0 findings (max 3 iterations)\n6. **Final Report** — summary of all findings, fixes, and verification status\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Scope Resolution\n\nDetermine the review target and extract the base branch.\n\n- **PR mode** (default): Use `gh pr view` / `gh pr list` to resolve base branch\n  and display PR metadata (title, file count, additions/deletions).\n- **Branch mode** (`--base`): Use specified base branch directly.\n- **Uncommitted mode** (`--uncommitted`): Review working tree changes.\n\nIf no argument is given, auto-detect the user''s most recent open PR and confirm.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Codex Review\n\nLaunch the adversarial review as a background process.\n\n1. Run the review script with `run_in_background=true`:\n   ```\n   bash <skill-dir>/scripts/codex-subagent.sh --base <branch>\n   ```\n   Note: Codex CLI v0.105.0+ does not support combining `--base`/`--commit`\n   with a custom prompt. The built-in review logic is used automatically.\n   For `--uncommitted` mode (no diff target), pipe stdin for custom instructions:\n   ```\n   cat <prompt-file> | bash <skill-dir>/scripts/codex-subagent.sh --uncommitted\n   ```\n2. Inform the user the review is running (~20-50 min).\n3. The script parses Codex output and returns the final review text.\n\n### Error handling\n\n| Exit code | Meaning | Action |\n|-----------|---------|--------|\n| 0 | Success | Proceed to Phase 3 |\n| 1 | Codex error | Show error, offer retry or abort |\n| 127 | codex not found | Guide: `npm i -g @openai/codex` |\n\n### Environment overrides\n\n| Variable | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `CODEX_REVIEW_MODEL` | Override Codex model |\n| `CODEX_REVIEW_REASONING` | Override reasoning effort |\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Finding Analysis\n\nParse the raw Codex output into structured findings.\n\n### References\n\n- **Schema**: `references/schemas/review-findings.md` — field definitions,\n  severity/category/effort enums, status lifecycle\n- **Convention rules**: `.agents/skills/project-conventions/conventions.md` —\n  project coding conventions to cross-reference\n\n### Severity escalation/downgrade guide\n\n- **Escalate to Critical**: Unvalidated external input, secret exposure,\n  injection vectors, data integrity compromise\n- **Escalate to High**: API contract change without test update, possible\n  NoneType error, blocking I/O in async context\n- **Downgrade to Medium**: Correct functionality but violates conventions,\n  duplicate logic, unnecessary complexity\n- **Downgrade to Low**: Pure style, unused import, missing docstring\n\n### Convention-to-category mapping\n\n- Typing violations (dict, Mapping, object, getattr) -> `typing`\n- Anti-patterns (speculative fallbacks, duplicate state) -> `convention`\n- Structure violations (core/modules boundary, DI bypass) -> `architecture`\n- Testing gaps (contract change without test update) -> `testing`\n\n### Process\n\n1. Parse each finding from the raw output\n2. Assign severity and category using the schema definitions and guide above\n3. Cross-reference with project conventions\n4. Estimate fix effort\n5. Deduplicate (keep the most severe instance)\n6. Sort: severity desc, file path asc\n\n---\n\n## HITL Gate 1: Finding Review\n\nPresent all findings to the user as a summary table\n(ID, severity, category, file:line, title, effort).\n\nAsk the user to choose a fix scope:\n- Fix all (recommended)\n- Fix Critical/High only\n- Report only (no fixes)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: Atomic Fix Loop\n\nFor each approved finding, execute an atomic fix-verify-commit cycle.\n\n### Per finding:\n\n1. **Fix**: Read target file(s), apply the fix.\n2. **HITL Gate 2** (conditional): For Critical/High findings that modify existing\n   logic (not just adding new code), show the current and proposed code to the\n   user for confirmation. Medium/Low findings are auto-fixed.\n3. **Verify** (all must pass):\n   - `uvx ruff check .`\n   - `uvx ruff format --check .` (auto-fix and re-check if needed)\n   - `uv run ty check`\n   - `uv run pytest` (mapped test files, or full suite if no mapping found)\n4. **Commit**: `fix(review): P{i} - {title}`\n5. **On failure**: Roll back changes, mark finding as `skipped`, continue to next.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5: Re-review Loop\n\nAfter all fixes are committed, automatically re-run the Codex review\nto check for regressions or new issues introduced by the fixes.\n\n### Loop behaviour\n\n1. Re-run Codex review (`--base <branch>`) against the same base.\n2. Parse findings (Phase 3) and present to user (HITL Gate 1).\n3. If **0 findings** → loop terminates, proceed to Final Report.\n4. If findings exist → execute Phase 4 (fix-verify-commit), then repeat\n   from step 1.\n\n### Safety limits\n\n- **Max iterations**: 3 (initial review + 2 re-reviews).\n  After 3 iterations, terminate the loop regardless of remaining findings\n  and output the Final Report with unresolved items noted.\n- **Escalation**: If the same finding recurs across 2 consecutive iterations,\n  mark it as `wont_fix` and skip in subsequent iterations.\n\n### HITL override\n\nAt each re-review result, the user may choose:\n- **Continue** — proceed with fixes (default when findings > 0)\n- **Stop** — terminate the loop early and output Final Report\n\n---\n\n## Final Report\n\nOutput a summary including:\n- PR metadata (number, title, base/head)\n- Loop iteration count and termination reason (clean / max iterations / user stop)\n- Findings table (ID, severity, category, title, status, commit hash)\n- Commit stack\n- Verification status (ruff, ty, pytest)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:17:19.026Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced adversarial testing and automated fix loop capabilities via Codex CLI","zh":"适合需要高级对抗测试和自动修复循环功能的代码审查代理，通过Codex CLI实现","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが高度な対抗テストと自動修復ループ機能を必要とする場合に最適で、Codex CLI経由で実現","ko":"고급 적대적 테스트 및 자동 수정 루프 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합하며, Codex CLI를 통해 구현","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan pruebas adversarias avanzadas y capacidades de bucle de reparación automatizado a través de Codex CLI","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Revue de Code ayant besoin de tests adverses avancés et de capacités de boucle de correction automatique via Codex CLI","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte gegnerische Tests und automatisierte Fehlerbehebungsloop-Funktionen über Codex CLI benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de testes adversariais avançados e capacidades de loop de fixação automatizado via Codex CLI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов проверки кода, которым требуются продвинутые функции проверки и автоматизированные возможности исправления через Codex CLI","ar":"مثالي لعميل استعراض الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى اختبارات معارضة متقدمة وخصائص حل التكرار الآلي عبر واجهة سطر أوامر Codex"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive content analysis, launch adversarial code reviews, and utilize HITL-gated fix loops with optional re-verification, all while tracking usage and providing OpenCode-compatible endpoints","zh":"赋予代理执行全面内容分析、启动对抗代码审查和利用HITL-gated修复循环的能力，具有可选的重新验证，并跟踪使用情况，提供OpenCode兼容的端点","ja":"エージェントに包括的なコンテンツ分析を実行し、対抗コードレビューを起動し、HITL-gated修復ループを利用する能力を付与し、オプションの再検証を提供し、使用状況を追跡し、OpenCode互換のエンドポイントを提供","ko":"에이전트가 종합적인 내용 분석을 수행하고, 적대적 코드 리뷰를 시작하고, HITL-gated 수정 루프를 활용하는 기능을 부여하며, 선택적인 재검증을 제공하고, 사용 상황을 추적하며, OpenCode 호환 엔드포인트를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un análisis de contenido integral, lanzar revisiones de código adversarias y utilizar bucles de reparación con verificación opcional, todo mientras se rastrea el uso y se proporcionan puntos finales compatibles con OpenCode","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour effectuer une analyse de contenu complète, lancer des revues de code adverses et utiliser des boucles de correction avec une révélation facultative, le tout en suivant l''utilisation et en fournissant des points de terminaison compatibles OpenCode","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Inhaltsanalysen durchzuführen, gegnerische Code-Reviews zu starten und HITL-gesteuerte Fehlerbehebungsloop mit optionaler Überprüfung zu nutzen, während die Nutzung verfolgt und OpenCode-kompatible Endpunkte bereitgestellt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análise de conteúdo abrangente, iniciar revisões de código adversárias e utilizar loops de fixação com verificação opcional, além de acompanhar o uso e fornecer pontos de extremidade compatíveis com OpenCode","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять комплексный анализ контента, запускать проверки кода и использовать циклы исправления с возможностью повторной верификации, а также отслеживать использование и предоставлять конечные точки, совместимые с OpenCode","ar":"يمكن العميل من أداء تحليل محتوى شامل وإطلاق مراجعات الشفرة المعارضة واستخدام حلقات إصلاح مع التحقق الاختياري، بالإضافة إلى تتبع الاستخدام وتوفير نقاط نهاية متوافقة مع OpenCode"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for pull requests","Debugging uncommitted local changes using Codex Review","Verifying fixes through optional re-verification loops"],"zh":["自动化拉取请求的代码审查","使用Codex Review调试未提交的本地更改","通过可选的重新验证循环验证修复"],"ja":["プルリクエストのコードレビューを自動化する","Codex Reviewを使用してコミットされていないローカル変更をデバッグする","オプションの再検証ループを使用して修復を検証する"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화","Codex Review를 사용하여 커밋되지 않은 로컬 변경 사항을 디버깅","선택적인 재검증 루프를 통해 수정 사항을 검증"],"es":["Automatizar revisiones de código para solicitudes de extracción","Depurar cambios locales no confirmados utilizando Codex Review","Verificar correcciones a través de bucles de verificación opcional"],"fr":["Automatiser les revues de code pour les demandes d''extraction","Déboguer les modifications locales non validées en utilisant Codex Review","Vérifier les corrections via des boucles de révision facultative"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Pull-Requests","Debuggen von nicht committeten lokalen Änderungen mit Codex Review","Überprüfen von Korrekturen durch optionale Überprüfungsschleifen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para solicitações de pull","Depurar alterações locais não comprometidas usando Codex Review","Verificar soluções por meio de loops de re-verificação opcionais"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверок кода для запросов на слияние","Отладка не зафиксированных локальных изменений с помощью Codex Review","Проверка исправлений через необязательные циклы повторной верификации"],"ar":["أتمتة مراجعة الشفرة لطلبات الاندماج","تصحيح الأخطاء في التغييرات المحلية غير الملتزمة باستخدام Codex Review","التحقق من الحلول من خلال حلقات إعادة التحقق الاختيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Codex CLI access","Dependent on OpenCode compatibility","Limited to reviewing changes against a base branch or uncommitted local changes"],"zh":["需要Codex CLI访问","依赖OpenCode兼容性","仅限于查看基准分支或未提交的本地更改"],"ja":["Codex CLIへのアクセスが必要","OpenCodeの互換性に依存","ベースブランチまたはコミットされていないローカル変更のみをレビューする"],"ko":["Codex CLI 액세스가 필요","OpenCode 호환성에 의존","기반 분기 또는 커밋되지 않은 로컬 변경 사항만을 리뷰"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Codex CLI","Dependiente de la compatibilidad con OpenCode","Limitado a la revisión de cambios contra una rama base o cambios locales no confirmados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à Codex CLI","Dépend de la compatibilité avec OpenCode","Limité à la revue des modifications par rapport à une branche de base ou des modifications locales non validées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Codex CLI","Abhängig von OpenCode-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf Überprüfung von Änderungen gegen einen Basiszweig oder nicht committete lokale Änderungen"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao Codex CLI","Depende da compatibilidade com OpenCode","Limitado à revisão de alterações contra um branch base ou alterações locais não comprometidas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Codex CLI","Зависит от совместимости с OpenCode","Ограничен проверкой изменений против базовой ветки или не зафиксированных локальных изменений"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر أوامر Codex","يعتمد على التوافق مع OpenCode","محدود بالتحقق من التغييرات ضد فرع قاعدة أو التغييرات المحلية غير الملتزمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f1017c1e026ac4526ee32af49b67e02bc445a02bcc99dc06ee0c1ab48a98e29d","qualityScore":75}');
