étence jira-issues permet aux développeurs de créer et de gérer des problèmes Jira de manière efficace.","de":"Die Fähigkeit jira-issues ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Jira-Probleme effizient zu erstellen und zu verwalten.","pt":"O skill jira-issues permite criar e gerenciar issues Jira de forma unificada. Ele oferece detecção de tecnologia inteligente e instalação por projeto.","ru":"Навык jira-issues позволяет создавать и управлять задачами Jira в единой системе. Он предлагает умную детекцию технологий и установку по проекту.","ar":"المهارة jira-issues تسمح بإنشاء وإدارة قضايا جيرا بطريقة موحدة. أنها توفر الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا والتركيب للمشروع.","en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart..."},"definition":{"en":"Unified multi-agent skill system for AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini) with 414+ skills, 38 agents, and 57 commands. Features smart tech   detection, per-project installation, and auto-sync from upstream sources."},"features":{"zh":["Jira REST API","MCP","414","38","57","API"],"ja":["Jira REST API","MCP","414","38","57","API"],"ko":["Jira REST API","MCP","414","38","57","API"],"es":["Creación de incidencias Jira","Gestión de incidencias Jira","Integración con la API de Jira","Instalación de servidor MCP","Configuración de variables de entorno","Sincronización automática desde fuentes de aguas arriba"],"fr":["Création de problèmes Jira","Gestion de problèmes Jira","Intégration à l''API Jira","Installation du serveur MCP","Configuration des variables d''environnement","Synchronisation automatique depuis les sources amont"],"de":["Erstellung von Jira-Problemen","Verwaltung von Jira-Problemen","Integration in die Jira-API","Installation des MCP-Servers","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen","Automatische Synchronisation von Quellen"],"pt":["Criação e gerenciamento de issues Jira","Detecção de tecnologia inteligent